{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/546","id":4518001574,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKDql7s8AAAABDUs7pg","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/546","diff_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/546.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/546.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/546","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/546/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/546/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/546/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/statuses/c1ec88501fb42d76ae32103daa5ed9e29d07b66d","number":546,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Prepare 0.14.0: Kotlin 2.4.20, Compose 1.12.0, AGP 9.4, compileSdk 37","user":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n**0.14.0 is published** (release run [34748782626](https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/actions/runs/34748782626)). This PR brings `main` up to date with the release branch: latest Kotlin / Compose Multiplatform, AGP 9 with the new KMP Android library plugin, compileSdk 37, and a green CI.\n\n### Toolchain\n\n| | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Kotlin | 2.4.10 | **2.4.20** |\n| Compose Multiplatform | 1.11.1 | **1.12.0** |\n| Material3 (CMP table) | 1.11.0-alpha07 | **1.12.0-alpha03** |\n| JetBrains Navigation (sample, CMP table) | 2.9.2 | **2.10.0-alpha02** |\n| AGP | 8.13.2 | **9.4.0** |\n| compileSdk | 36 | **37** |\n| Gradle | 9.0.0 | **9.7.1** (AGP 9.4 needs ≥ 9.6) |\n| kotlinx-datetime / Coil / Ktor / Vanniktech / kyant | | 0.8.0 / 3.6.2 / 3.5.2 / 0.37.0 / 2.0.1 + 1.2.1 |\n\nCompanion versions follow the CMP 1.12.0 release-notes table.\n\n### AGP 9 migration\n\nAGP 9's new DSL no longer allows `com.android.library` + `org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform` in the same subproject, so:\n\n- All `calf-*` modules (and `sample:common`) now use **`com.android.kotlin.multiplatform.library`** via the convention plugin. `androidTarget()` / `android.library.gradle.kts` are gone; the target is configured in `Android.kt` (`kotlin { android { } }`, single variant, published through the regular KMP publication). `withHostTest {}` keeps `commonTest` running on the Android JVM (`testAndroidHostTest` is part of `allTests`).\n- The hierarchy template matches the AGP target explicitly: KGP's `withAndroidTarget()` is an `instanceof KotlinAndroidTarget` check that silently excluded `materialMain` from the Android compilation.\n- `sample:android` uses AGP's built-in Kotlin (no `org.jetbrains.kotlin.android` plugin, no `kotlinOptions`), drops the obsolete manifest `package` attribute.\n- Dropped dead `gradle.properties` flags (`kotlin.mpp.androidSourceSetLayoutVersion`, `kotlin.mpp.androidGradlePluginCompatibility.nowarn`, `kotlin.js.compiler`) and the Gradle 9.6-deprecated `by registering` task DSL.\n\n### Behaviour notes\n\n- **Library minSdk stays 23.** androidx navigation 2.10+ declares minSdk 24, so `calf-navigation` keeps androidx navigation at 2.9.7. Only the sample app moves to minSdk 24 (JetBrains navigation 2.10's Android artifact requires it).\n- Web targets declare `binaries.executable()`: CMP 1.12 fails `jsBrowserTest`/`wasmJsBrowserTest` otherwise (`checkComposeUiTestConfigurationFor*`, CMP-4906). Published klibs are unchanged.\n- CI runners move from `macos-14` to `macos-26`: CMP 1.11+ links against iOS 26 SDK frameworks (`UIUtilities`), which is why `main` is currently red (`linkDebugTestIosSimulatorArm64`: \"framework 'UIUtilities' not found\").\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `./gradlew assemble` – all modules, all targets (Android AAR, desktop, iOS arm64 + simulator, JS, Wasm) and all sample apps (Android debug/release APK, desktop, web, iOS frameworks)\n- [x] `./gradlew allTests` – desktop (80 tests), Android host (32), JS + Wasm browser, iOS simulator; all green\n- [x] CI (`Java CI with Gradle`) green on this PR (build job 20 min on macos-26)\n- [x] `deploy.yml` dispatched with `0.14.0` from `0.14.x` completed successfully (run 34748782626: build, native libs, publish to Maven Central, version bump). The automated bump commit was fast-forwarded onto this branch and its PR #547 closed as a duplicate.\n\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-13T09:01:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T10:44:20Z","closed_at":"2026-09-13T10:44:19Z","merged_at":"2026-09-13T10:44:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"dcc2cf93f42cba76117e52ea5ac9f9ca0a4bc7fe","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MohamedRejeb:0.14.x","ref":"0.14.x","repo":{"id":674932206,"node_id":"R_kgDOKDql7g","name":"Calf","full_name":"MohamedRejeb/Calf","owner":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"htt